        {"target": 2, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.2},
        {"target": 3, "effect": "fade", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.3}
      ],
      "notes": "把问题抛出来：我们在浏览器里写了几年前端，却很少思考‘为什么浏览器脚本不能读文件’。答案指向 V8 + Libuv 的组合——也正是 Node.js 与浏览器 JS 的根本分水岭。",
      "shapes": [
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 1.75, "w": 5.9, "h": 3.0, "fill": {"color": "FAFAFA"}, "line": {"color": "CCCCCC", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "浏览器沙箱", "size": 20, "bold": true, "color": "C00000", "spaceAfter": 10},
           {"text": "• 只能操作 DOM / BOM、页面 UI", "size": 16, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 无文件系统访问", "size": 16, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 无进程与网络原语", "size": 16, "color": "444444"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 6.85, "y": 1.75, "w": 5.9, "h": 3.0, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "line": {"color": "1F4E79", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "Node.js · 操作系统绑定", "size": 20, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "spaceAfter": 10},
           {"text": "• fs：文件读写、目录操作", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• net / http：网络通信", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• child_process：进程管理", "size": 16, "color": "333333"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 5.15, "w": 12.15, "h": 1.35, "fill": {"color": "1F4E79"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "答案的核心组合：V8（执行与内存）＋ Libuv（系统能力）", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "align": "center", "spaceAfter": 5},
           {"text": "JS 从此真正拥有“操作系统的权限”，这才有了后端的故事", "size": 14, "color": "C9DCF0", "align": "center"}
         ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": {"text": "非阻塞 I/O：Node.js 的基因，而不是插件", "size": 28, "align": "left"},
      "subtitle": {"text": "一个“点餐叫号”的类比", "size": 15},
      "bg": {"type": "solid", "color": "F7F9FC"},
      "transition": {"type": "fade"},
      "animations": [
        {"target": 0, "effect": "appear", "trigger": "click"},
        {"target": 1, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.2},
        {"target": 2, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.2},
        {"target": 3, "effect": "fade", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.3}
      ],
      "notes": "用餐厅类比把‘非阻塞’讲清楚：多线程模型像‘一桌一个服务员’，并发靠无限加人；Node 模型是一个服务员叫号，菜好了再通知。结论落在‘异步非阻塞是基因，不是后来的插件’。",
      "shapes": [
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 1.7, "w": 5.9, "h": 3.2, "fill": {"color": "FAFAFA"}, "line": {"color": "CCCCCC", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "传统多线程（每桌一个服务员）", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "555555", "spaceAfter": 10},
           {"text": "• 一个请求 = 一个线程", "size": 16, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 服务员全程等着上菜 → 线程阻塞在 I/O", "size": 16, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 并发 = 开更多桌（线程）→ 内存与上下文切换爆炸", "size": 16, "color": "444444"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 6.85, "y": 1.7, "w": 5.9, "h": 3.2, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "line": {"color": "1F4E79", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "Node.js 单线程 + 叫号系统", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "spaceAfter": 10},
           {"text": "• 一个服务员负责叫号（事件循环）", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 菜好了再通知顾客（回调 / 事件）", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 等菜的间隙继续服务其他桌 → 高并发", "size": 16, "color": "333333"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 5.25, "w": 12.15, "h": 1.25, "fill": {"color": "1F4E79"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "异步非阻塞，是 Node.js 的基因 —— 并发模型的基础，而不是后来的插件。", "size": 18, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "align": "center"}
         ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": {"text": "深入黑盒：V8 + Libuv，谁在真正干活？", "size": 28, "align": "left"},
      "subtitle": {"text": "关键认知：setTimeout / fs.readFile 都不是 JS 引擎做的", "size": 15},
      "bg": {"type": "solid", "color": "F7F9FC"},
      "transition": {"type": "fade"},
      "animations": [
        {"target": 0, "effect": "appear", "trigger": "click"},
        {"target": 1, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.1, "durationSec": 0.5},
        {"target": 2, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.15, "durationSec": 0.5},
        {"target": 3, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.15, "durationSec": 0.5},
        {"target": 4, "effect": "fade", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.3}
      ],
      "notes": "黑盒拆解：V8 只管执行；Libuv 才是 I/O 的枢纽——把操作交给内核或线程池，完成后扔回事件循环。强调‘主线程从不干等 I/O’是理解后续所有并发模型的前提。",
      "shapes": [
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.7, "y": 1.75, "w": 5.2, "h": 1.1, "fill": {"color": "2E7D32"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "V8 引擎", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "spaceAfter": 2},
           {"text": "解析并执行 JavaScript 代码", "size": 13, "color": "E8F5E9"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.7, "y": 3.0, "w": 5.2, "h": 1.1, "fill": {"color": "1F4E79"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "Libuv", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "spaceAfter": 2},
           {"text": "事件循环 · 线程池 · 跨平台系统 API", "size": 13, "color": "C9DCF0"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.7, "y": 4.25, "w": 5.2, "h": 1.1, "fill": {"color": "37474F"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "操作系统内核 / 线程池", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "spaceAfter": 2},
           {"text": "fs · socket · timers 系统调用", "size": 13, "color": "CFD8DC"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 6.3, "y": 1.75, "w": 6.45, "h": 3.6, "fill": {"color": "FFFFFF"}, "line": {"color": "CCCCCC", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "拆开看三类“async”", "size": 18, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "spaceAfter": 10},
           {"text": "setTimeout → 内核定时器，不是 JS 引擎计时", "size": 15, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "fs.readFile → Libuv 线程池执行，完成回调扔回队列", "size": 15, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "网络 I/O → epoll / kqueue 内核事件驱动", "size": 15, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "主线程从不“干等” I/O —— 这就是非阻塞", "size": 15, "bold": true, "color": "C00000"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "text", "text": "单向依赖：JS 代码 → V8 调用 → Libuv → 内核", "x": 0.7, "y": 5.5, "w": 5.2, "h": 0.5, "size": 14, "color": "666666", "align": "center"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": {"text": "核心机制：Event Loop 的六个阶段，Poll 是灵魂", "size": 28, "align": "left"},
      "subtitle": {"text": "不要背阶段名，理解数据怎样流动", "size": 15},
      "bg": {"type": "solid", "color": "F7F9FC"},
      "transition": {"type": "fade"},
      "animations": [
        {"target": 0, "effect": "appear", "trigger": "click"},
        {"target": 1, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.1, "durationSec": 0.4},
        {"target": 2, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.1, "durationSec": 0.4},
        {"target": 3, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.1, "durationSec": 0.4},
        {"target": 4, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.1, "durationSec": 0.4},
        {"target": 5, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.1, "durationSec": 0.4},
        {"target": 6, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.1, "durationSec": 0.4},
        {"target": 7, "effect": "fade", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.3}
      ],
      "notes": "六阶段按序循环：Timers → Pending → Idle → Poll → Check → Close。重点只讲两点：①Poll 是处理已就绪 I/O 回调的心脏；②setImmediate 与 setTimeout(fn,0) 的顺序不固定，取决于执行时 Poll 是否空闲。现场互动：让听众猜 Promise.resolve().then 与 setTimeout 的输出顺序。",
      "shapes": [
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.5, "y": 1.78, "w": 1.8, "h": 0.8, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "paragraphs": [{"text": "Timers", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"}]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 2.6, "y": 1.78, "w": 1.8, "h": 0.8, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "paragraphs": [{"text": "Pending", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"}]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 4.7, "y": 1.78, "w": 1.8, "h": 0.8, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "paragraphs": [{"text": "Idle", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"}]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 6.8, "y": 1.78, "w": 1.8, "h": 0.8, "fill": {"color": "C00000"}, "paragraphs": [{"text": "Poll ★", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "align": "center"}]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 8.9, "y": 1.78, "w": 1.8, "h": 0.8, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "paragraphs": [{"text": "Check", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"}]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 11.0, "y": 1.78, "w": 1.8, "h": 0.8, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "paragraphs": [{"text": "Close", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"}]},
        {"kind": "text", "text": "→", "x": 2.25, "y": 1.85, "w": 0.35, "h": 0.6, "size": 22, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"},
        {"kind": "text", "text": "→", "x": 4.35, "y": 1.85, "w": 0.35, "h": 0.6, "size": 22, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"},
        {"kind": "text", "text": "→", "x": 6.45, "y": 1.85, "w": 0.35, "h": 0.6, "size": 22, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"},
        {"kind": "text", "text": "→", "x": 8.55, "y": 1.85, "w": 0.35, "h": 0.6, "size": 22, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"},
        {"kind": "text", "text": "→", "x": 10.65, "y": 1.85, "w": 0.35, "h": 0.6, "size": 22, "color": "1F4E79", "align": "center"},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.5, "y": 2.95, "w": 12.3, "h": 2.2, "fill": {"color": "FFFFFF"}, "line": {"color": "CCCCCC", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "• Poll：处理已就绪的 I/O 回调，是六阶段的心脏", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• setImmediate 与 setTimeout(fn, 0) 的顺序不固定 —— 取决于 Poll 是否空闲", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• timers 到期、check 回调都要经过队列排队；理解它比背阶段名更重要", "size": 16, "color": "333333"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.5, "y": 5.45, "w": 12.3, "h": 1.15, "fill": {"color": "1F4E79"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "现场互动：猜一猜 Promise.resolve().then 与 setTimeout(fn, 0) 谁先输出？（检验是否真懂 Node 的试金石）", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "align": "center"}
         ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": {"text": "单线程 ≠ 单能力：多进程与多线程", "size": 28, "align": "left"},
      "subtitle": {"text": "cluster 与 worker_threads 的正确打开方式", "size": 15},
      "bg": {"type": "solid", "color": "F7F9FC"},
      "transition": {"type": "fade"},
      "animations": [
        {"target": 0, "effect": "appear", "trigger": "click"},
        {"target": 1, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.2},
        {"target": 2, "effect": "fly", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.2},
        {"target": 3, "effect": "fade", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.25}
      ],
      "notes": "常见的认知误区：单线程 ≠ 没能力。cluster 通过多进程吃满多核；worker_threads 在同进程内并行 CPU 密集任务。但必须明确边界：Node.js 天生适合 I/O 密集，CPU 密集该走 worker_threads 或拆微服务。",
      "shapes": [
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 1.7, "w": 5.9, "h": 3.15, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "line": {"color": "1F4E79", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "cluster（多进程）", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "spaceAfter": 10},
           {"text": "• 每个 CPU 核一个独立进程", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 进程间内存隔离，故障隔离性好", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 适合横向扩多核 / 多机", "size": 16, "color": "333333"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 6.85, "y": 1.7, "w": 5.9, "h": 3.15, "fill": {"color": "E8F2FA"}, "line": {"color": "1F4E79", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "worker_threads（多线程）", "size": 19, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "spaceAfter": 10},
           {"text": "• 同进程内多线程，可共享内存", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 适合 CPU 密集型任务的并行", "size": 16, "color": "333333", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 开销小于进程，但需注意线程安全", "size": 16, "color": "333333"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 5.2, "w": 12.15, "h": 1.3, "fill": {"color": "C00000"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "误区纠正：Node.js 适合 I/O 密集型，不适合 CPU 密集型；CPU 密集请交给 worker_threads 或拆分为独立微服务。", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "align": "center"}
         ]}
      ]
    },
    {
