    {
      "title": {"text": "全链路追踪：AsyncLocalStorage 的无侵入染色", "size": 28, "align": "left"},
      "subtitle": {"text": "告别 request-id 逐层传递，一行代码拿到上下文", "size": 15},
      "bg": {"type": "solid", "color": "F7F9FC"},
      "transition": {"type": "fade"},
      "animations": [
        {"target": 0, "effect": "appear", "trigger": "click"},
        {"target": 1, "effect": "fade", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.2},
        {"target": 2, "effect": "fade", "trigger": "afterPrev", "delaySec": 0.25}
      ],
      "notes": "ALS 的价值：用一个 store 替代手写传递 request-id；任何异步深处都可以 store.getStore() 拿到请求上下文，结合 pino 让每条日志自动带上追踪 ID。这是把“日志排查”变成“工程能力”的杠杆。",
      "shapes": [
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 1.7, "w": 5.5, "h": 3.4, "fill": {"color": "1E1E2E"},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "const store = new AsyncLocalStorage()", "font": "Consolas", "size": 13, "color": "E6E6E6"},
           {"text": "", "size": 8},
           {"text": "app.use((req, res, next) => {", "font": "Consolas", "size": 13, "color": "E6E6E6"},
           {"text": "  store.run({ requestId: genId() }, next)", "font": "Consolas", "size": 13, "color": "E6E6E6"},
           {"text": "})", "font": "Consolas", "size": 13, "color": "E6E6E6"},
           {"text": "", "size": 8},
           {"text": "// 任意深处：无侵入读取", "font": "Consolas", "size": 13, "color": "8FA9C8"},
           {"text": "store.getStore()?.requestId", "font": "Consolas", "size": 13, "color": "9FD1FF"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 6.4, "y": 1.7, "w": 6.35, "h": 3.4, "fill": {"color": "FFFFFF"}, "line": {"color": "CCCCCC", "widthPt": 1},
         "paragraphs": [
           {"text": "为什么值得做", "size": 18, "bold": true, "color": "1F4E79", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 替代 request-id 逐层传递的手工染色", "size": 15, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 每个请求的日志自动携带上下文", "size": 15, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 结合 pino：一条请求的完整时间线可回溯", "size": 15, "color": "444444", "spaceAfter": 8},
           {"text": "• 微服务 + 分布式排查的隐形基础设施", "size": 15, "color": "444444"}
         ]},
        {"kind": "rect", "x": 0.6, "y": 5.4, "w": 12.15, "h": 1.05, "fill": {"color": "1F4E79"},
         "paragraphs": [{"text": "对技术人员而言：这是把“日志排查”变成“工程能力”的杠杆。", "size": 17, "bold": true, "color": "FFFFFF", "align": "center"}]}
      ]
    },
